ontent": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le08ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to enhance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to improve something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Feng shui can actually enhance the quality of your sleep."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about your room."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "makeover"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "painting the walls, putting in new furniture to make a place a makeover look more attractive by"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to give my room a makeover!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mirror"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a piece of special glass that you can look at and see yourself in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many mirrors in this room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wall "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one of the sides of a room"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have got to paint these walls!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "earthy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "looking like earth"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's suggested to decorate the bedroom with earthy colors. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bed linen"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the sheets and pillowcases for a bed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's important to watch bed linens every two weeks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "duvet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large cloth bag filled with feathers or similar material that you use to cover yourself in bed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can buy yourself a new duvet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cushion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a cloth bag filled with soft material that you put  on a bed, chair or the floor to make it more comfortable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I might buy a few cushions while I'm there."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob10aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Passive!"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Passive Voice</span> when the focus is in the action and when the person who performs the action is not important or unknown."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb to be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ <span class=\\\"underline\\\">past participle</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Mirrors <span class=\"strong\">are</span> <span class=\"underline\">thought</span> to bounce energy around the bedroom."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They will <span class=\"strong\">be</span> <span class=\"underline\">removed</span> tomorrow."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The walls <span class=\"strong\">were</span> <span class=\"underline\">painted</span> yesterday."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Necessity and Advisability"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about what is necessary, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>.</p>  When you talk about what is advisable, you use <span class=\"italic\">need to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advisability\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've got to try out Feng Shui.</p>   I'm going to have to write down all the ideas I have.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I could go to the mall with Sally.</p>  I  ought to paint the walls of my bedroom. </p>  You'd better get rid of all these mirrors. </p> I should decide on which colour I want.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look at magazines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Cut out things you would want in your room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using the pictures you cut out, make a collage. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph (8-10 lines) to go along with your collage, include words to talk about what is advisable and what is necessary. For example. <span class=\"italic\">I ought to get a bigger bed because \u2026 or I'm going to have to paint my walls \u2026 </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your collage to your class. Read your paragraph aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find objects in a bedroom."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what is necessary. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what is advisable."}]}]}